From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ykai55 <ykai55@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add native renderer C API

Add an ABI-versioned C facade over the OSS Fiber renderer, including opaque
host/session/node/timer registries, native event forwarding, TASM-owned timers,
pipeline flushing, and function-table seam coverage.

